hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1455","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kisi musalman shakhs ka ye haq nahi ke us ke paas koi cheez ho jis mein wasiyat karni ho aur wo do raatein guzar le magar ye ke us ki wasiyat us ke paas likhi hui ho."
"1456","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Hazm se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Amr bin Sulaim Zuraqi ne unhein khabar di ke Umar bin Khattab se kaha gaya ke yahan Ghassan ka aik ladka hai jo jawan ho gaya hai aur ehtelaam ko nahi pahuncha aur us ka waris Sham mein hai aur wo maal wala hai aur yahan us ke siwa us ki chacha-zaad behan ke koi nahi. Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke use us ke liye wasiyat karni chahiye. Unhon ne kaha ke phir us ne us ke liye aik maal ki wasiyat ki jise Bir Jashm kaha jata hai. Amr bin Sulaim ne kaha ke phir wo maal tees hazar dirham mein becha gaya, aur us ki chacha-zaad behan jis ke liye us ne wasiyat ki thi wo Amr bin Sulaim Zuraqi ki walida hain."
"1457","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Hazm se riwayat kya ke Ghassan ka aik ladka Madina mein maut ke qareeb hua aur us ka waris Sham mein tha, to ye baat Umar bin Khattab se bayan ki gai aur un se kaha gaya ke fulan mar raha hai to kya wo wasiyat kare. Unhon ne kaha ke use wasiyat karni chahiye. Yahya bin Saeed ne kaha ke Abu Bakr ne kaha ke ladka das ya barah saal ka tha. Unhon ne kaha ke phir us ne Bir Jashm ki wasiyat ki aur us ke ghar walon ne use tees hazar dirham mein becha. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm ye hai ke kam-aql, bewaqoof aur wo majnoon jo kabhi hosh mein aata hai un ki wasiyatein jaiz hain jab un ke paas apni aqlon mein se itni ho jis se wo samjhen ke wo kis ki wasiyat kar rahe hain, aur jo apni aql mein se itna na rakhta ho jis se wo samjhe ke wo kis ki wasiyat kar raha hai aur wo apni aql par maghloob ho to us ki koi wasiyat nahi."
"1458","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Aamir bin Saad bin Abi Waqqas se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Hajjatul Wida ke saal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere paas aaye meri ayadat karne, aik dard se jo mujhe sakht ho gaya tha, to maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah mujhe dard is had tak pahunch gaya hai jo Aap dekhte hain aur main maal wala hun aur meri waris sirf meri aik beti hai to kya main apne maal ke do tihaai sadqa kar dun. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. To maine kaha ke phir aadha. Aap ne farmaya ke nahi. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tihaai, aur tihaai bahut hai, tum apne warison ko ghani chhoro ye is se behtar hai ke tum unhein mohtaaj chhoro jo logon se mangte phirein, aur tum jo kharch bhi Allah ka chehra chahte hue kharch karo ge magar tumhein us ka ajr diya jaye ga yahan tak ke jo tum apni biwi ke munh mein rakhte ho. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah kya main apne sathiyon ke baad peechhe reh jaunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum peechhe nahi rahoge aur koi nek amal karo ge magar tum is se darja aur bulandi mein badhoge, aur shayad tum peechhe raho yahan tak ke tum se kuchh qoumein faida uthain aur dusri tum se nuqsan uthain, aey Allah mere sahaba ki hijrat ko poora farma aur unhein un ki aidiyon par na lauta, lekin bechara Saad bin Khaula, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us par rehem karte hain ke wo Makka mein mar gaya."
"1459","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke aik mukhannas Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ke paas tha. To us ne Abdullah bin Abi Umayya se kaha jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sun rahe they ke aey Abdullah agar Allah ne kal tum par Taif fatah kar di to main tumhein Ghailan ki beti ka pata batata hun, wo aage se chaar lekar aati hai aur peechhe se aath lekar jati hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye log tumhare paas dakhil na hon."
"1460","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Qasim bin Muhammad ko kehte suna ke Umar bin Khattab ke paas Ansar mein se aik aurat thi aur us ne un ke liye Aasim bin Umar ko jana, phir unhon ne use juda kar diya, phir Umar Quba aaye aur apne bete Aasim ko masjid ke sehan mein khelta paya, to unhon ne us ke baazu ko pakda aur use apne samne sawari par bithaya, to ladke ki dadi ne use pa liya aur us se us ke bare mein jhagadne lagi yahan tak ke dono Abu Bakr Siddiq ke paas aaye. Umar ne kaha ke mera beta hai. Aur aurat ne kaha ke mera beta hai. To Abu Bakr ne kaha ke us ke aur is ke darmiyan khula chhor do. Unhon ne kaha ke Umar ne un se baat na lautayi. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke is mein jo hukm liya gaya hai wo yehi hai."
"1461","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Abul Darda ne Salman Farsi ko likha ke muqaddas zameen ki taraf aao, to Salman ne unhein likha ke zameen kisi ko muqaddas nahi karti, insan ko sirf us ka amal muqaddas karta hai, aur mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke tum tabeeb ban gae ho jo ilaj karte ho, phir agar tum shifa dete ho to tumhein mubarak, aur agar tum apne aap ko tabeeb banate ho to daro ke kahin kisi insan ko qatal kar do aur jahannam mein dakhil ho jao. Phir Abul Darda jab do ke darmiyan faisla karte phir wo dono un ke paas se peeth pher lete to unhein dekhte aur kehte ke laut aao taake apni kahani mujhe dobara sunao, Allah ki qasam main apne aap ko tabeeb banane wala hun. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke jo apne aaqa ki ijazat ke baghair ghulam se kisi cheez mein madad le jis ke liye ujrat hai aur us jaisi ke liye ujrat hai to wo us ka zamin hai jo ghulam ko pahunche agar ghulam ko kuchh pahunche, aur agar ghulam salamat rahe phir us ke aaqa ne us ke kaam ki ujrat talb ki to ye us ke aaqa ke liye hai aur hamare nazdeek yehi hukm hai. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke wo ghulam jo kuchh azad ho aur kuchh ghulam ho us ka maal us ke haath mein roka jaye ga aur use is mein koi nai cheez karne ka haq nahi, lekin wo is mein se maroof ke sath khae aur pehne, phir jab wo halaak ho to us ka maal us ke liye hai jis ke paas us mein ghulami baqi rahi. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke hamare nazdeek hukm ye hai ke walid apne bete ka hisaab lega jo us ne us par kharch kya us din se jab bete ka maal ho, naqd ho ya saman, agar walid ye chahe."
"1462","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Umar bin Abdur Rahman bin Dallaf Mazni se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Juhaina ka aik shakhs hajiyon se aage nikal jata aur sawariyan khareed kar un mein mehngai karta phir tez chal kar hajiyon se aage nikal jata, phir wo muflis ho gaya aur us ka mamla Umar bin Khattab ke paas uthaya gaya to unhon ne kaha ke amma baad, aey logon, Usaifi Juhaina ka Usaifi apne deen aur amanat se is par razi ho gaya ke kaha jaye ke wo hajiyon se aage nikla, khabardaar wo saamne aakar qarz-daar ho gaya hai aur ab us par mohar lag gai hai, phir jis ka us par qarz ho wo kal subah hamare paas aaye taake hum us ka maal un ke darmiyan taqseem karein, aur qarz se bacho kyunke us ka awwal fikr hai aur aakhir ladai."
"1463","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Usman bin Affan ne kaha ke jis ne apne chhote bache ko jo qabza karne ko nahi pahuncha koi atiya diya aur us ke liye is ka elaan kya aur is par gawah banaya to ye jaiz hai chahe us ka wali us ka baap ho. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm ye hai ke jis ne apne chhote bete ko sona ya chandi atiya kya phir wo halaak ho gaya jabke wo us ka wali hai ke bete ke liye is mein se kuchh nahi magar ye ke baap ne use alag karke muayyan kar diya ho ya use aik shakhs ke hawale kar diya ho aur use apne bete ke liye us shakhs ke paas rakh diya ho, phir agar us ne aisa kya to ye bete ke liye jaiz hai."
